Quackify's native Spotify player (`krespot-player`) is marked by its author as proprietary /
source-available with copying prohibited, and is Android-only. No Quackify code or asset is included.

## Services

Valen is not affiliated with Spotify AB, Google/YouTube, or SoundCloud. Spotify plays through its
official Web Player and the user's own account; YouTube Music and SoundCloud stream the addresses
their own APIs hand out to clients. No DRM is circumvented.
